{
  "source": {
    "description": "Vectors for the zkgroup profile-key version and profile-key commitment as computed by libsignal v0.99.1 (the libsignal-client bundled with signal-cli v0.14.7). See spec/crypto/zkgroup-profile.md. All hex is lowercase; points are 32-byte RFC 9496 ristretto255 encodings; scalars are 32-byte little-endian integers reduced mod the group order.",
    "libsignal_repository": "https://github.com/signalapp/libsignal",
    "libsignal_tag": "v0.99.1",
    "libsignal_commit": "97801d22dcf9f5bf714f7b8fa3212cdc973ae1c8",
    "provenance": {
      "sho_hmac_sha256.upstream": "Copied as data from the unit test in rust/poksho/src/shohmacsha256.rs @ 97801d22 (the 64-byte and 65-byte outputs and the long-sequence 63-byte output).",
      "sho_hmac_sha256.derived": "Chaining-value states computed by the spec agent from the construction in the spec (HMAC-SHA256); cv_after_label was cross-checked with openssl HMAC.",
      "system_params.concatenated_96": "Equal byte for byte to the hardcoded 96-byte constant in rust/zkgroup/src/crypto/profile_key_commitment.rs @ 97801d22 (upstream data).",
      "system_params (other fields)": "Computed by the spec agent with a throwaway scratch implementation of the spec (not delivered, deleted); it reproduces the upstream constant above.",
      "cases[].version and cases[].commitment": "Computed offline by the reference distribution: jshell with class path /work/third_party/signal-cli-0.14.7/lib/* (libsignal-client-0.99.1.jar, native libsignal_jni), calling org.signal.libsignal.zkgroup.profiles.ProfileKey(bytes).getProfileKeyVersion(aci).serialize() and .getCommitment(aci).serialize() with aci = new ServiceId.Aci(UUID.fromString(...)). No network.",
      "cases[].intermediate": "Computed by the spec agent's throwaway scratch implementation of the spec (not delivered, deleted). For every case it reproduced the jar's version and full 97-byte commitment exactly, so the intermediates are consistent with libsignal; but libsignal does not expose them, so they are not independently confirmed beyond that.",
      "upstream_fixed_vectors": "libsignal v0.99.1 has no fixed test vectors for the profile-key version or commitment (Rust, Java, Node, Swift tests searched); its tests only check determinism."
    }
  },
